# S3, member a (k10): first into stag0101 (NEW); b joins about 15 s later, c 15 s after b; then all three go west
# and out by matz02 together (one group move).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
wander 460 170 15 until present=3,sealed>=300
log all three here
route {route:stag0101_west}
log at the exit
wander -320 -184 4 until frames>=900
mat matz02 yes 3 until stage=stag0102,control
log in stag0102
wander 330 140 15 until sealed>=4200
log enough
idle until frames>=60
